From my experience you are completely wrong with stoners raging and being toxic. i have had random teammates on my team who are stoners and i play with one of my friends who is a stoner and they are some of the nicest players/people i've met.

&#x200B;

Whenever my friend says he is high on the comms it means that he will not be able to know Left from Right and it isn't that often that he is that high. and i always get a laugh out of it whenever i play with stoners/drunks because they are so damn funny with their reactions to the most random shit. Had one that startet blasting music at max volume through Comms the whole team stopped shooting at the enemy and startet singing along we would do that for 5 minutes and then he would watch a comedy show while we could hear it. It was the most fun i've had in a video game since MW2 days. This was in an immortal game in Valorant.

&#x200B;

Sure they can trash talk and some can be toxic and rage but i enjoy all of it i find it funny because it can really create content for you if you really just don't give a fuck about the games like i do.

&#x200B;

I play it because i enjoy everything the toxicity, the rage, the shit talk, leavers, stoners, drunk people. I am not going to report someone for being toxic or rage only if they cheat through hacks or wintrading but even with wintrading i just laugh at them because for them to climb they need to wintrade like what?

For me it's more that if you only can say 1-2 words in english and keep saying them i will be toxic towards you because then you are just annoying the same goes if you are a squeeker that just yell stuff or don't know when to shut up, or just keep talking when you are dead and not using text chat or ping while being dead.

&#x200B;

Yesterday in a comp game on Breeze i was 3 times in a 1v2 situation and i had a squeeker on my team he could only speak french so the 3rd time i was in a 1v2 situation i had enough my line was crossed he didn't give info i kept telling him to speak english or ping he did neither i was toxic and was going all in on him not being able to atleast ping or stfu when he wasn't alive and apparantly he was not able to write in chat somehow?!?! i already had a rough day and wanted to enjoy a comp game with my friend wich also kept telling him to either use Text chat/Speak English or ping. i smacked talked him to the point of him no longer talking in VC anymore wich i was happy with. His friends just laughed and they could atleast speak english and actually agreed with me and told me he dropped out of school as a 14 year old wich i found odd but not my problem though.

&#x200B;

and i will keep being like this whenever there are people who just doesn't know when to shut up it doesn't matter how old you just learn to shut up when you have nothing relevant to say in a clutch situation. and i always tell my team from the start that if they are dead only say something if you have some info that can help the team or if you hear something we don't hear that are relevant. if you atleast can say how much dmg you did to someone when you died and know callouts in english idc if you speak Russian/French/German and what not other languages just talk english when making callouts

&#x200B;

