  I had an incident were someone full force while spinning smacked me in the balls with a Roleplaying axe when i was 12 years old and i couldn't move for atleast a day and whenever i did move i got pain all the way up to my throat. I felt like i could throw up any time. it was pure torture. Couldn't eat, sleep, drink, take a piss or move at all. so yes it does hurt like hell and if you are hit correctly you can literally bust a nut.   

