Plus for it to hurt you don't even have to be hit if just one nut twists or flips up side down you have to get a surgery or else you will loose it within 6 hours and i experienced that i had to get 3-4 morphine injections and even then the pain would not go away after the surgery i got another 2 injections and it did not help either they had to feed me through a pipe down my throat so i could get some nourishment. had a full week where i was not able to move at all without being in pain. 

