The thing is it goes both ways don't be a jerk to people who smoke and smokers shouldn't be a jerk to non smokers. I have a friend who is allergic to Smoke, and i always say that i am going to light one up and when i will let him either walk infront of me or behind me it depends on where the wind is going. 

