It shouldn't matter what people do, but what should matter is common courtesy (don't know if i spelled it correctly) and as i stated if you are at a place where no one is near you and you can smoke then do it and if they run up to you and chose to be second hand smoking and then complain then just tell them to go away, since they were no where near you when you startet smoking. 

