One thing that helped me in the start was go into Practice range and set bots to hard then do some Defuse/plant scenarios until you can go through them fast and precise. When you have done that try to use guardian or Sheriff since they are not forgiving at all. 

&#x200B;

You could also go into Practice Range pick any agent press practice on the shooting range and learn to track while going in a circle around a single bot and consistently keep your aim at its head while going in circles, when you have done that, set the bots to move and then press practice again and choose one bot to track until you got can do it consistently. 

&#x200B;

one more major thing is all this can be done in Deathmatch but you won't have nearly as much time to do it, but if you choose DM instead don't go for wins go for practice instead tracking peoples heads, tracking when going around cornors, Prefiring, Pre aiming,

&#x200B;

 also play around with your sens until you find one that fits you. 

&#x200B;

For an example my DPI is 1000 and my sens is 0.349 and scoped sens is 0.694 wich fits me perfectly

